      "name": "opm-simple-state-vector",
      "clause": "G2",
      "note": "Figure G-1, the first OPM example: a state vector with spacecraft parameters and no Keplerian block. The COMMENT sits after ORIGINATOR, which puts it at the head of the metadata section rather than in the header \u2014 clause 7.8.7 allows a header comment only immediately after the version keyword.",
      "config": {
        "structure": "opm"
      },
      "input": "",
