      "note": "The second OPM example: state vector, Keplerian elements, spacecraft parameters and two planned maneuvers, with units written out after most values and comments opening each block. Its two header comments sit between the version keyword and CREATION_DATE, which is the only place clause 7.8.7 allows them.",
